ic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-13T10:03:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T10:07:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121321","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121321.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121321.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAdds extra styling options to the `OptionButton`'s arrow icon for the hover, pressed, hover pressed and disabled states. When one of the newer icons isn't available it will always fall back to the base `arrow`\r\n\r\nBefore (note that all the font color options were kept at their default here):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ad44737-7ade-4887-a090-f65dda5d2545\r\n\r\nAfter (note that all the font color options were set to white here to avoid double changing them since the new arrow icons already have their color changes baked in):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57acd396-1b7f-4945-972a-6dd20b865789\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI did consider making the color for the arrow its own property but eventually decided against that and instead keeping the font colors as they are to avoid a breaking change for something relatively minor. Technically it could be seen as a bug that the font colors are used for the arrow icon, but at the same time this also makes sense in a way as it's an extension of the text on the button already.\r\n\r\nHere's the test project I used during this, [guitest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29962077/guitest.zip), note that I did this based on the master branch and thus the changes from #120766 aren't applied here yet (including in the before and after clips), but the OptionButton extends the regular Button class so these will automatically be applied if the button styling PR gets merged in.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121321/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121321/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}